docs {
  # Get Reagents

  This endpoint retrieves every reagent in the tenant's seed catalog.

  ## Response

  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "4021000",
        "type": "reagents",
        "attributes": {
          "stat": "STR",
          "value": 1
        }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
